mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">月之暗面开源 2.8 万亿参数 Kimi K3.1 Pro 模型权重并登顶 Agent Arena</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布全新网络安全模型，自动化挖掘并修复948个Linux内核提权漏洞</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Kimi开放平台发布Kimi Hosted Agents，将Harness运行时转为云端托管服务</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包工作正式接入第三方模型，首批上线Kimi、智谱与DeepSeek</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d920e5095af766f1e5bde33cf9dac4e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">10月29日，字节跳动旗下办公Agent产品“豆包工作”订阅版与企业订阅版全面接入第三方模型，首批上线Kimi K3.1Pro、GLM5.3及DeepSeek V4.1Flash。此举标志着该产品打破单一自研模型限制，向多元化模型生态转型。功能上线后默认开启，企业用户无需额外采购，调用消耗的Token直接从账户AI点数中扣除。平台管理员可按成员、部门、群组或全员细化权限，并支持在电脑端、移动端、网页端及飞书内嵌等场景配置模型调用。业内分析认为，此举旨在帮助企业根据任务复杂度精细化管理Token成本，实现降本增效。此外，同属字节体系的扣子企业版宣布将于2026年11月30日起停止接受新客户购买。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达联合发布实时交互基准Realtime-Bench，GPT-6-Astra成功率仅44%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f427fa5c2d92a15cc77ab1b6b6a1c035.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达携手得克萨斯大学奥斯汀分校发布实时交互任务基准Realtime-Bench，旨在评估AI在动态环境下的实时感知、时间自适应推理及行动时机把握能力。该基准包含50个涵盖八类场景的任务，并设置三种环境推进时钟协议。对全球12款前沿大模型的测试显示，当前主流AI在实时任务中表现欠佳，表现最优的GPT-6-Astra在真实推理耗时场景下的任务成功率仅为44%，高推理强度下三次全成功概率仅36%。研究指出，模型在极低延迟与深度推理之间难以平衡，盲目提升推理强度无法线性提高成功率，且单纯缩短延迟无法解决实时交互难题。Realtime-Bench的推出揭示了当前大模型在实时感知方面的技术瓶颈，为后续迈向AGI的研发提供了关键评估标杆。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">月之暗面开源 2.8 万亿参数 Kimi K3.1 Pro 模型权重并登顶 Agent Arena</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f522f27f968293bce5fa641ed861e48a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月5日，月之暗面（Moonshot AI）正式在 Hugging Face 平台开源 2.8 万亿参数的 Kimi K3.1 Pro 模型权重。该模型采用 MoE 架构，单次推理激活 1040 亿参数，支持 100 万 Token 上下文。在 Agent Arena 智能体排行榜中，Kimi K3.1 Pro 夺得开放权重模型首位，综合净改进率达 +5.1%。核心指标方面，其 Bash Reliability 跃居开放模型第一，Steerability 达 +6.5%。技术上，该模型通过门控稀疏注意力层优化了长上下文计算开销，并历经大规模联合强化学习后训练。在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 基准测试中，其得分达 65.7%，表现接近 Claude Opus 5.5。受限于 1.4TB 的 INT4</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布全新网络安全模型，自动化挖掘并修复948个Linux内核提权漏洞</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4874f5a00ff55f1e2572bbe64943156c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月4日发布安全研究报告，展示了一款即将推出的网络安全模型。该模型构建了涵盖漏洞发现、验证、利用及修复的闭环流程。在2026年10月的实战测试中，系统从2308个候选漏洞中动态复现了1724个，并成功生成948个Linux内核提权漏洞利用程序。测试显示，平均每个漏洞利用程序的生成成本仅为1279美元，总API消耗为121万美元。此外，该系统还生成了291个信息泄露漏洞的PoC程序，并能自动编写候选修复补丁。目前，OpenAI已向Linux内核社区提交了数百份严重漏洞报告及对应补丁，显著提升了开源操作系统的安全防护效率。该成果标志着AI在自动化安全攻防领域具备了工业级应用潜力，通过AI驱动的“破”与“立”，大幅降低了漏洞挖掘与修复的经济成本。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Kimi开放平台发布Kimi Hosted Agents，将Harness运行时转为云端托管服务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/abd4daa7d4d143670eed637e6e3bbe07.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Kimi开放平台正式发布Kimi Hosted Agents，将支撑智能体运行的Harness作为云端服务（Harness as a Service）提供。开发者无需自建运行框架，即可获得7×24小时托管环境，支持长程任务执行与多智能体协作。该服务旨在降低Agent落地门槛，将企业数月的底层工程投入缩短为按需调用的云服务，涵盖代码执行、上下文管理、工具调用及权限控制。平台内置140+ Skills与30+插件，并提供Kimi Inference Hook安全组件，在推理前拦截敏感数据。此外，平台同步上线8个金融Agent模板，支持企业集成至内部系统或嵌入对外产品。通过提供独立沙箱、网络访问控制及执行过程审计，Kimi Hosted Agents助力企业快速实现从原型验证到生产环境的部署。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
